    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d401">

                <pb facs="0430" n="332" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg332"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President to the German Emperor.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Executive Mansion</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-08-12"><hi rendition="#italic">August 12,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am gratified to receive Your Majesty’s message of goodwill in relation to the
                    selection of Count Waldersee, and, like you, I see in our common duty an
                    additional recognition of the kindly ties and mutual interests that exist
                    between this country and Germany.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William McKinley.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
